flowchart TD
    A[Source Code] -->|gcc -fsanitize=address -g| B[Instrumented Binary]
    B --> C[ASan Runtime Library]
    
    C --> D{Memory Operations}
    D -->|malloc/free| E[Track Allocations]
    D -->|Load/Store| F[Check Shadow Memory]
    
    F --> G{Shadow Byte Valid?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Allow Access]
    G -->|No| I[Detect Error]
    
    I --> J[Heap buffer overflow]
    I --> K[Stack buffer overflow]
    I --> L[Use after free]
    I --> M[Use after scope]
    I --> N[Double free]
    
    J --> O[Print Stack Trace]
    K --> O
    L --> O
    M --> O
    N --> O
    
    O --> P[Abort Program]
    
    style C fill:#fff4e1
    style I fill:#ffe1e1
    style O fill:#ffe6e6
    style H fill:#e8f5e8
    
    Q[Shadow Memory] --> Q1["1 byte tracks 8 bytes, 0xFF = valid, 0xFA = left redzone, 0xFD = freed"]
